flowchart TD
  A[Home Recommended Task Panel] --> B[Select Difficulty]
  B --> C[Render Task Cards]
  C --> D[Open Task Detail]
  D --> E[Read Task Catalog Item]
  E --> F[Show Objective Tutorial Steps Criteria]
  F --> G[User Clicks I Did It]
  G --> H{Task Already Completed?}
  H -- Yes --> I[Do Not Award XP Again]
  H -- No --> J[Add Task ID To completedTaskIds]
  J --> K[Increase totalXp By Difficulty Reward]
  K --> L[Derive Level From XP]
  L --> M[Derive Stage From Level]
  M --> N[Persist taskProgress In localStorage]
  N --> O[Homepage Progress Updates]
